# Privacy Policy for Boysatwork

**Last Updated:** October 1, 2026

Boysatwork ("we", "our", or "us") operates the Boysatwork mobile application and the website https://boysatwork.in (collectively, the "Services"). We are committed to protecting your personal privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our mobile application and related services.

Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. By accessing or using our Services, you consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your information in accordance with this policy.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

We collect information that you provide directly to us, as well as data gathered automatically when you access or use our application.

### A. Personal Information You Provide
When you register, schedule a service, or contact us, we may collect:
* **Contact Details:** Full name, phone number, and email address.
* **Service Address:** House/flat number, street, area, landmark, and postal code where services are to be delivered.
* **Booking Information:** Selected service categories (plumbing, electrical, carpentry, AC repair, etc.), requested dates, preferred time slots, and additional instructions.
* **Customer Support Inquiries:** Records of communications via WhatsApp, direct calls, or support forms.

### B. Location Information
To enable accurate service delivery and assign nearest available service technicians, our application may collect:
* **Precise or Approximate Geolocation:** Collected with your permission when you use location detection features to pin your service delivery address.
* You can enable or disable location services at any time through your device settings.

### C. Automatically Collected Technical Information
When you use our mobile application, our systems may automatically log:
* Device information (device model, operating system version, unique device identifiers).
* App performance data, crash logs, and diagnostic reports.
* IP address and basic network connection details.

---

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We use the collected information for legitimate business purposes, including:
* Processing, confirming, and dispatching home service bookings.
* Connecting you with certified service technicians for on-site repairs and maintenance.
* Communicating updates, booking confirmations, invoices, and service status through SMS, WhatsApp, phone calls, or email.
* Improving application stability, speed, and user experience.
* Responding to customer service inquiries, disputes, and feedback.
* Preventing fraudulent transactions and ensuring safety and security.

---

## 3. Sharing and Disclosure of Information

We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties. We may disclose your information under the following limited circumstances:

* **With Service Technicians:** We share your name, contact phone number, and service address with assigned technicians solely to perform the requested home services.
* **With Third-Party Service Providers:** We work with trusted infrastructure providers (cloud hosting, database management, SMS/WhatsApp delivery gateways, crash analytics) who process data strictly under confidentiality agreements.
* **Legal and Regulatory Obligations:** We may disclose your information if required to do so by applicable law, court order, governmental authority, or to protect the safety, rights, and property of Boysatwork, our users, or the public.

---

## 4. Third-Party Services

Our mobile application is built using modern frameworks and may integrate with third-party service providers who have their own privacy policies:
* **Google Play Services:** Used for app distribution, analytics, and device integrity.
* **Expo Framework:** Used for native runtime and application updates.
* **WhatsApp Business API:** Used for customer communications and instant booking notifications.

---

## 5. Data Security

We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, loss, alteration, or disclosure. All network communications between your mobile device and our backend servers are secured using industry-standard HTTPS/TLS encryption.

While we take rigorous measures to safeguard your information, no transmission over the internet or wireless network can be guaranteed 100% secure.

---

## 6. Data Retention and Deletion

* We retain your personal data only as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.
* **Account and Data Deletion:** You have the right to request the deletion of your personal data at any time. To request data deletion, contact us at contact@boysatwork.in with your registered phone number. We will process and confirm your request within 30 business days.

---

## 7. Children's Privacy

Our Services are intended for adults aged 18 and older. We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under the age of 13 (or under 18 in jurisdictions where consent is required). If we become aware that a child has provided us with personal data, we will promptly delete such information from our records.

---

## 8. Permissions Used by the Application

To deliver full functionality, our Android application may request the following permissions:
* **ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION and ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION:** To automatically detect your location for selecting service addresses.
* **INTERNET and ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE:** To connect with backend servers and process service bookings.
* **POST_NOTIFICATIONS:** To send booking updates, technician arrival alerts, and service reminders.

---

## 9. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our operational, legal, or regulatory requirements. We will notify you of any material changes by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this policy. Continued use of our application after any modifications indicates your acceptance of the updated policy.

